{"unit_id":"SMSMy__dsh-arabic#card-zh","repo":"SMSMy/dsh-arabic","commit":"2a88efe41fe7f1fcb1dede1220843155bab8881c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-arabic 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的阿拉伯语界面插件。它通过 webserver/index-inject 注入混合阿拉伯语和英语文本的方向与排版层，并由客户端接入 DSH 官方语言服务。主要功能包括按文本内容判断段落方向、让代码块保持从左到右、注册带英语回退的阿拉伯语界面翻译，以及在通用设置中提供 RTL 开关。插件还为界面、长文阅读和标题提供 Thmanyah 字体，并通过 DSH 的 webserver 路由供应字体文件。适合用阿拉伯语阅读和操作 DSH 的用户；无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1103-1142","lib/client.js:140-170"]}
{"unit_id":"SMSMy__dsh-arabic#card-en","repo":"SMSMy/dsh-arabic","commit":"2a88efe41fe7f1fcb1dede1220843155bab8881c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-arabic adds Arabic UI support to DSH web and desktop. It injects bidi-aware text direction, keeps code left-to-right, registers Arabic through DSH locale, and adds a General settings RTL switch. Thmanyah fonts are served by the DSH web server. No API key or external account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1103-1142","lib/client.js:140-170"]}
